<div class="page public-page public-article">
    <header class="public-intro"><h1>About the Class 9 MCQ Bank</h1><p>An independent practice resource for FBISE SSC-I students and teachers.</p></header>
    <article class="card report-card public-copy">
        <h2>What you can study</h2>
        <p>The site helps Class 9 students practise Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics and Computer Science. The study guides connect chapter topics and revision strategies to the FBISE assessment frameworks for the National Curriculum of Pakistan 2022–23.</p>
        <h2>How the practice bank is organized</h2>
        <p>Questions are grouped by subject and chapter and tagged by the skill involved. Sample quizzes provide quick feedback without an account. Students who sign in can choose chapters, question types and test length, then review past results and track progress by Bloom’s level.</p>
        <h2>How to report an issue</h2>
        <p>The import process flags missing and conflicting answer keys for review. If an option, diagram or classification seems wrong, use the contact form and include enough detail to identify the item. Feedback helps prioritize corrections against the source material and applicable framework.</p>
        <p><a href="/contact">Report an issue</a> · <a href="@McqExam.WebAPI.PublicStudyCatalog.Frameworks">Official FBISE assessment frameworks</a></p>
    </article>
</div>
